WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
How much we spent for lunch
at Super Nintendo World.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
We ate at Toadstool Cafe.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.750
This is a phenomenal
restaurant and it just

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.000
might be the best in
the entire theme park.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
To start things off, I got a Luigi Burger.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.500
That's a chicken sandwich with
fries and pesto sauce. Amazing!

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.000
That was $16.99.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
I also got some Coke in this
sweet Nintendo World Cup.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That was $4.25.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
My friend JP got the Mario Burger.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
It has bacon, sauce, and
mushrooms. That was $16.99.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
To top things off, we got
these cheesy garlic knots.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
10 out of 10. They cost $5.99.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
All this for a grand
total of just over $44.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
And this is officially...
